# The raw LLM response cache (~10.9k entries) is distributed as a GitHub release
# asset (.llm_cache.tar.gz), not committed to git, so the clone stays lean. The
# offline reproduction (reproduce.sh) runs from the frozen result files and does not
# require the cache; download and extract the asset only to RE-run model calls.
